module

public import LeanPool.Superdiffusion.Algsuperdiff.Section3.Provider.Stream.CutoffLawTransport
public import LeanPool.Superdiffusion.Algsuperdiff.Section4.Probability.IndicatorArray
public import LeanPool.Superdiffusion.Algsuperdiff.Section4.Probability.LayerIndependence

/-!
# ShellColumnIndep

Ported from scottnarmstrong/Superdiffusion at 7f20476385d4af418f110303085ad0740c9eba46.
Module imports, support namespace and local option directives adapted for Lean Pool.
